1 0 0 1 48 560 Tm (1. Capture the trigger [Same day \(30-90 min\)]) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 547 Tm (Save the notice, portal message, invoice, or verbal summary that started the dispute about) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 534 Tm (inspection rights, written requests, and follow-up. Note the date received.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 521 Tm (   Documents: Violation notice, invoice, or portal message; Envelope postmark or delivery receipt; Dated note of when you first learned of the issue) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 508 Tm (   Avoid: Relying on a verbal warning without a written artifact; Forgetting to photograph the notice date and cited rule) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 495 Tm (2. Pull controlling text [1-3 days]) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 482 Tm (Locate the statute, CC&R, rule, and fine-schedule language that supposedly authorizes action) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 469 Tm (on inspection rights, written requests, and follow-up.) Tj
