1 0 0 1 48 443 Tm (   Avoid: Arguing fairness before confirming the board cited a real rule; Using an outdated schedule that no longer matches the ledger) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 430 Tm (3. Build the evidence spine [2-5 days]) Tj
