1 0 0 1 48 404 Tm (records to demand first.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 391 Tm (   Documents: Dated photos or maintenance logs; Correspondence export; Comparable-neighbor notes \(when relevant\); One-page exhibit index) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 378 Tm (   Avoid: Photos without dates, landmarks, or consistent angles; Dumping unsorted emails instead of labeled exhibits) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 365 Tm (4. Choose the procedural path [Per notice window \(often 7-14 days\)]) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 352 Tm (Pick cure, informal dispute, formal hearing, payment under protest, ADR, or counsel based on) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 339 Tm (deadlines and stakes around inspection rights, written requests, and follow-up.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 326 Tm (   Documents: Deadline calendar from the notice and bylaws; Draft remedy sentence \(waive / reduce / re-notice / reverse\); Proof of any cure already completed) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 313 Tm (   Avoid: Missing the internal appeal deadline while still gathering evidence; Asking for conflicting remedies in the same letter) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 300 Tm (5. Submit a written ask [1-2 hours to finalize + send]) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 287 Tm (Send one clear remedy request \(waive, reduce, re-notice, or reverse\) tied to what records to) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 274 Tm (demand first, with exhibits attached.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 261 Tm (   Documents: Signed appeal or dispute letter; Indexed exhibits; Certified-mail / portal delivery proof) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 248 Tm (   Avoid: Sending exhibits without a clear ask on the first page; Failing to keep delivery proof for the appeal packet) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 235 Tm (6. Confirm the outcome in writing [1-7 days after hearing or board action]) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 222 Tm (Demand or calendar a written decision, update your ledger notes, and decide whether) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 209 Tm (escalation is still proportionate.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 196 Tm (   Documents: Written decision or refusal-to-decide record; Updated ledger screenshot; Post-decision deadline calendar) Tj
